  "full_text": "Well, I'm feeling pretty healthy. If you're in good standing, you should be able to talk to your guardian angel. Not everyone has a guardian angel. Kind of a weird thing. So if you're not in good standing, generally prayer and fasting can allow you to talk to your guardian angel. What it is for me or for the people that I talk to is maybe you tilt your head back and you say, guardian angel, guardian angel. I didn't hear anything. And you should hear them respond. So, well, anyway, your spiritual health can go up and down. And, you know, I never practiced prayer and fasting. and I'm running low on food and it's not hurting me.",
